## Testing Service Layer

**✅ Direct Service Testing (Preferred)**
```python
import pytest
from src.services.ai_brand_os.research.research_service import ResearchService

@pytest.mark.asyncio
async def test_research_service():
    # No HTTP context needed!
    service = ResearchService()
    
    result = await service.execute_research_question(
        session_id="test",
        chat_id="test",
        question_index=9,
        language="English",
        chat_model="gemini-flash"
    )
    
    assert result["status"] == "success"
    assert "research" in result
```

**❌ HTTP Testing (Only for Integration Tests)**
```python
from fastapi.testclient import TestClient

def test_endpoint_integration():
    # Use only for integration tests
    client = TestClient(app)
    response = client.post("/research/async/", json={...})
    assert response.status_code == 202
```

